}], "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8087334418183565`*^9, 3.8087334484885187`*^9}, {
   3.840623522414098*^9, 3.8406235933922443`*^9}, {3.847436109074675*^9, 
   3.847436109144519*^9}, 3.847438477876051*^9, {3.9036864675012693`*^9, 
   3.9036864676160116`*^9}, 3.9036865670725236`*^9, {3.9681336165422163`*^9, 
   3.968133617262168*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"13e2a78b-cda4-47d4-8d7d-\
3539878ca38c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "State in detail, the linear regression model used, the cost function \
associated with it and the values of the parameters found by the Gradient \
Decent method.\n",
 StyleBox["Answer:",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0., 0., 1.]]
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8406077677898483`*^9, 3.8406077805787115`*^9}, {
   3.840607817148863*^9, 3.8406078233314943`*^9}, {3.840610140231086*^9, 
   3.8406101687976065`*^9}, {3.840611410450673*^9, 3.8406114111372795`*^9}, {
   3.8406118106191096`*^9, 3.8406118157377205`*^9}, {3.840619757198535*^9, 
   3.840619781346617*^9}, {3.84062003764408*^9, 3.840620044774067*^9}, {
   3.840620162977298*^9, 3.840620163057195*^9}, {3.840621198484002*^9, 
   3.8406212288327556`*^9}, {3.840623598025297*^9, 3.8406235983732743`*^9}, 
   3.840623693882882*^9, {3.90368616340644*^9, 3.9036861668461504`*^9}, {
   3.9681336344822006`*^9, 
   3.9681336525041304`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"da25c9ca-6778-4df5-837f-\
5ace775e23bc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "1. Hypothesis function - firstly computes the dot product of x theta for a \
single row. Then o applies h across every row in our feature matrix, which \
produces a vector of predicted prices\n2. Cost function (Mean squared error) \
- ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"h", "/@", "x"}], " ", "-", " ", "y"}], "  ", ")"}], "2"], 
   " "}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"c1f537db-e780-4752-8cd4-a9fe3cb8871b"],
 " calculates the squared error, Total[Flatten[ sums all squared errors, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FractionBox["1", 
   RowBox[{"2", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Times", "@@", 
     RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "y", "]"}]}]}]]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->
  "9fbbf562-9cbd-4c32-821b-2172b9fc73b7"],
 " multiplies the squared errors by 1 / 2m\n3. The Gradient - Grad[cost[\
\[Theta]Vars],#]& /@ \[Theta]Vars asks mathematica to differentitiate the \
cost with respects to every parmameter in [Theta]Vars, which results in the \
exact gradient\n4. Gradient decent algorithim - firstly assign a learning \
rate \[Alpha] = 0.1; then initialise theta with random values from -1 to 1 \
\[Theta] = Table[RandomReal[{-1,1}],{n+1},{ny}]; Within the do loop, Do[\
\[Theta]= \[Theta]-\[Alpha] dCost[\[Theta]]; \
AppendTo[costList,cost[\[Theta]]]; ,{i,1,100}]; We execute our gradient \
decent algorithim which updates the values of theta that minimise J[theta]. \
We do the step 100 times and append the steps to a list for plotting.\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8406077657661633`*^9, 3.8406077988842287`*^9}, {
  4.003848146152365*^9, 4.0038482456402698`*^9}, {4.003848291021915*^9, 
  4.003848337191732*^9}, {4.003848377298998*^9, 4.0038485512919416`*^9}, {
  4.00384860211891*^9, 4.0038486377500362`*^9}, {4.00384867878578*^9, 
  4.0038487822143364`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"20de9576-d17c-4273-90ea-\
9210aeb5c5e2"],

Cell["Code used to produce answer:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8406212671583977`*^9, 3.840621294907153*^9}, {
  3.840623759650882*^9, 3.8406237597957306`*^9}},
 FontWeight->"Bold",
 FontColor->RGBColor[
  0., 0., 1.],ExpressionUUID->"d28d6f27-233a-4587-8261-91bcbd635a6e"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Hypothesis function", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.003848813666237*^9, 
  4.0038488260993924`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"73cc1e9c-156c-4d68-9300-\
ea8b855be7d1"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"h", "[", "x_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"x", ".", "\[Theta]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"o", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
     RowBox[{"h", ",", "x"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "  "}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"e", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"o", "-", "y"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0038488318008165`*^9, 
  4.0038488331971393`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"26fb2583-7dc5-42f5-b27f-\
96d0e8392549"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. Cost function", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0038488377962723`*^9, 
  4.003848840683479*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"1cab50c6-6240-4a78-acb5-\
b5c64d2a0b39"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"cost", "[", "\[Theta]VarsInput", "]"}], " ", "=", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"N", "[", "     ", 
      RowBox[{
       FractionBox["1", 
        RowBox[{"2", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Times", "@@", 
          RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "y", "]"}]}]}]], 
       RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "    ", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", "   ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"h", "/@", "x"}], " ", "-", " ", "y"}], "  ", ")"}], "2"],
          "     ", "]"}], "]"}]}], "       ", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"924b5979-9ba4-483d-bd9b-f6669550d679"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3. Partial derivatives of the Gradient", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0038488543838263`*^9, 
  4.0038488744823723`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9ea19499-9d79-4a13-941c-\
1d440c68af4c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"dCost", "[", "\[Theta]VarsInput", "]"}], " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Expand", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{"N", "[", "        ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Grad", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"cost", "[", "\[Theta]Vars", "]"}], ",", "#"}], "]"}], 
        "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "\[Theta]Vars"}], "     ", "]"}], "]"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"54de077d-093e-4e14-8c22-\
cb9a160e9082"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Gradient Decent Algorithm", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0038489174665375`*^9, 4.0038489270576744`*^9}, 
   4.003848971865255*^9},ExpressionUUID->"8f258f24-e2d5-4774-bafa-\
738415d5a5ff"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
